Package: remoment-node
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ReMoment <noreply@remoment.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, systemd
Recommends: ffmpeg
Suggests: cyanrip
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/remoment/remoment-server
Description: ReMoment Node, a headless helper for a ReMoment server
 Registers with the server (found by mDNS or set in the config), waits for
 the admin to approve it and then runs the roles the admin switches on:
 line-in, CD ripper and offline sync target. Static Go binary, no
 dependencies besides systemd.
